!data/keystone_seeds.jsonl
!data/keystone_bridges.jsonl
# the Nesting — domain spines + the edges that root the science half in the one floor — CONTENT
!data/nesting_seeds.jsonl
!data/nesting_bridges.jsonl
# the periodic table nested — element sequence + created-order spine (no element an orphan) — CONTENT
!data/element_bridges.jsonl
# the Nested Control-Systems spine theories (the Closest Theories packet), seeded + nested — CONTENT
!data/ncs_seeds.jsonl
!data/ncs_bridges.jsonl
# The Corpus — the domain SPINES for the stored-source cards are CONTENT (git-tracked); the source
# cards themselves (data/source_cards.jsonl) are large + generated from the HD sources (gitignored).
!data/source_spines.jsonl
# The original-language Scripture (Greek NT + Hebrew OT, one card per verse) — the spines are CONTENT
# (git-tracked); the 31k verse cards are large + generated from the HD, like source_cards (gitignored).
!data/scripture_spines.jsonl
# The OEIS core — the spine is CONTENT (git-tracked); the 6k sequence cards are generated (gitignored).
!data/oeis_spine.jsonl
# The tree of life — the spine is CONTENT (git-tracked); the 38k organism cards are generated (gitignored).
!data/taxonomy_spine.jsonl
# The languages of the earth (PHOIBLE) — spine is CONTENT (git-tracked); the 2.2k language cards generated (gitignored).
!data/language_spine.jsonl
# More stored sources (RFCs, Matthew Henry, Spurgeon, activities) — spines CONTENT (git-tracked); cards generated (gitignored).
!data/reference_extra_spines.jsonl
# The Great Books (Project Gutenberg catalogue, acquired to the HD) — spine CONTENT (git-tracked);
# the 77k stub cards are generated (gitignored). The full texts live at the links, fetched on demand.
!data/gutenberg_spine.jsonl
# The theory assay carded — the calibration (not judgment) of the academy's theories — CONTENT
!data/theory_cards.jsonl
# The Lighthouse Field Kit — Matt's authored deck of 30 Scripture protocol cards — CONTENT (git-tracked)
!data/fieldkit_cards.jsonl
# The Fractal Playbook — Matt's authored framework (atomic unit + Four Gates) — CONTENT (git-tracked)
!data/playbook_cards.jsonl
# The systems of the world — the recurring form (effort/flow, shared equations, the shadow) — CONTENT
!data/systems_cards.jsonl
# The free-access catalogue — the lawful free tools we connect people to (logistics layer) — CONTENT
!data/access_tools_cards.jsonl
